      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a great start, the Rawls stuff is exactly what i needed. it looks like your last message cut off right as you were explaining the social democratic view of taxes. could you finish that thought?\n\nand once you finish that, could you maybe help me bridge the two? like, if i'm writing this essay, how would a philosopher from each side respond to the other's core premise? for example, how would a Nozickian reply to the \"veil of ignorance\" concept, and how would a Rawlsian counter the \"self-ownership\" argument? i want to show the real friction between these two systems.",
